<item>
                <title>Shielding Migration: Milan (MXP) to Milan (BGY)</title>
                <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #666666&quot;&gt;Our engineers are conducting scheduled maintenance to decommission the Milan (MXP) POP. This update will help to consolidate our network footprint in the Italy region. To learn more about shielding concepts, please read: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/documentation/guides/getting-started/hosts/shielding/&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #ffffff; font-size: inherit&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;https://www.fastly.com/documentation/guides/getting-started/hosts/shielding/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-e010f015-7fff-b862-53db-7a1c7d02364f&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #00759c; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;What&#x2019;s changing?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #666666; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Beginning October 26, 2026, and concluding by November 2, 2026, Fastly will gradually redirect shield traffic for the mxp-milan-it shield location to our Milan (BGY) POP. Services that use mxp-milan-it will continue to reference it, and the redirect will happen automatically.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #00759c; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;What&#x2019;s next? What do I have to do?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #666666; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;No action is required. You may update your service configuration to select the new shield location (bgy-milan-it) if you do not want Fastly to automatically transition your shielded content. If you elect to change your shield selection, your origin servers may experience a temporary increase in request volume while the cache re-establishes in BGY.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #666666; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;If you have any questions or concerns, please contact our Support team through &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://support.fastly.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;https://support.fastly.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; color: #666666; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt; or your account team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</description>
                <link>https://www.fastlystatus.com/incident/378900</link>
                <guid isPermaLink="false">/378900/817491</guid>
                <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 00:10:00 +0000</pubDate>
                    <sc:customfields>[]</sc:customfields>
            </item>
